        "description": "Retrieve the execution status and results of an asynchronous connector operation.\n\n**Status States:**\n- `queued`: Accepted and awaiting execution.\n- `running`: In progress.\n- `succeeded`: Completed with published post details in `result`.\n- `failed`: Failed with error details in `error`.\n\n*Note: Job status records are stored in memory and reset upon application restart.*",
